## How to choose a refurbished laptop

Refurbished laptops give you far more performance and build quality for your money than a new laptop at the same price. To get the best value, focus on the parts that affect everyday use.

### Start with the processor generation

A newer processor matters more than a higher model number. For most people, an **Intel Core i5 from the 8th generation onwards** — or an equivalent AMD Ryzen — is the sweet spot for office work, study and browsing. Newer generations bring better efficiency and longer software support.

### Insist on an SSD and enough RAM

An SSD is the single biggest factor in how fast a laptop feels. Pair it with at least **8GB of RAM**, or **16GB** if you multitask heavily, code or edit photos. Many business laptops have a free memory slot for easy upgrades later.

### Read the condition grade and battery health

Our grades — A+, A, B and C — describe **cosmetic condition only**. Every grade passes the same hardware tests, so choosing a lower grade is a smart way to save money if you don't mind a few marks. Battery health is measured and shown on every listing. Learn more about [condition grades](/condition-grades).

### Match the laptop to your work

- **Office work and study:** Dell Latitude, Lenovo ThinkPad or HP EliteBook business models. See [business laptops](/category/business-laptops).
- **Creative work and long battery life:** [refurbished MacBooks](/category/macbooks).
- **Gaming and 3D:** laptops with dedicated graphics. See [gaming laptops](/category/gaming-laptops).

### Set a budget

Browse by price: [under ₹20,000](/laptops/under-20000), [under ₹30,000](/laptops/under-30000) and [under ₹50,000](/laptops/under-50000).

## Why buy refurbished from us

Every laptop goes through our documented [nine-step refurbishment process](/how-we-refurbish): inspection, diagnostics, data erasure, cleaning, repair, quality testing, final inspection, packaging and insured shipping. If anything goes wrong, our [warranty](/warranty) and [7-day returns](/returns) have you covered.
